[00:00.000]Wellerman (Sea Shanty) - Nathan Evans
[00:00.000]QQ音乐享有本翻译作品的著作权
[00:00.970]Lyrics by：Nathan Evans/Alex Oriet/David Phelan/William Graydon/Samuel Brannan/Tom Hollings
[00:01.950]Composed by：Nathan Evans/Alex Oriet/David Phelan/William Graydon/Samuel Brannan/Tom Hollings
[00:02.920]曾经有一艘出海的船
[00:02.929]There once was a ship that put to sea
[00:05.390]那艘船的名字叫Billy of Tea
[00:05.392]The name of the ship was the Billy of Tea
[00:08.140]狂风呼啸 船头下沉
[00:08.141]The winds blew up her bow dipped down
[00:10.420]吹吧吹吧 尽管吹吧
[00:10.428]O blow my bully boys blow huh
[00:13.270]Wellerman很快就要来了
[00:13.276]Soon may the Wellerman come
[00:15.560]给我们带来糖 茶和朗姆酒
[00:15.566]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[00:18.230]等到一切结束的那一天
[00:18.237]One day when the tonguin' is done
[00:20.340]我们就能离开了
[00:20.348]We'll take our leave and go
[00:23.110]船离岸不到两个星期
[00:23.115]She had not been two weeks from shore
[00:25.480]一头露脊鲸冲了过来
[00:25.481]When down on her a right whale bore
[00:28.070]船长召集所有水手 发誓说
[00:28.073]The captain called all hands and swore
[00:30.480]他一定要把这头鲸拖回岸边
[00:30.489]He'd take that whale in tow huh
[00:33.170]Wellerman很快就要来了
[00:33.177]Soon may the Wellerman come
[00:35.510]给我们带来糖 茶和朗姆酒
[00:35.513]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[00:38.120]等到一切结束的那一天
[00:38.121]One day when the tonguin' is done
[00:40.340]我们就能离开了
[00:40.343]We'll take our leave and go
[00:53.220]在小船下水之前
[00:53.227]Before the boat had hit the water
[00:55.640]鲸鱼尾巴甩起来 打中了船身
[00:55.643]The whale's tail came up and caught her
[00:57.970]所有水手都到船舷来 用鱼叉与鲸鱼搏斗
[00:57.972]All hands to the side harpooned and fought her
[01:00.670]只是它又潜入了水中
[01:00.676]When she dived down low huh
[01:03.180]Wellerman很快就要来了
[01:03.188]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:05.500]给我们带来糖 茶和朗姆酒
[01:05.508]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:08.160]等到一切结束的那一天
[01:08.164]One day when the tonguin' is done
[01:10.380]我们就能离开了
[01:10.385]We'll take our leave and go
[01:13.000]钓索没有断 鲸鱼也没逃脱
[01:13.009]No line was cut no whale was freed
[01:15.540]船长并没有贪得无厌
[01:15.544]The captain's mind was not of greed
[01:17.990]而是坚守捕鲸者的信条
[01:17.996]And he belonged to the Whaleman's creed
[01:20.470]鲸鱼拖着船行进
[01:20.476]She took that ship in tow huh
[01:23.190]Wellerman很快就要来了
[01:23.196]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:25.500]给我们带来糖 茶和朗姆酒
[01:25.501]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:28.120]等到一切结束的那一天
[01:28.124]One day when the tonguin' is done
[01:30.330]我们就能离开了
[01:30.331]We'll take our leave and go
[01:42.940]四十多天时间
[01:42.942]For forty days or even more
[01:45.520]钓索松弛了下来 后来又绷紧了
[01:45.527]The line went slack then tight once more
[01:48.030]所有小船都失踪了 只剩四艘
[01:48.033]All boats were lost there were only four
[01:50.360]但那一头鲸鱼依然在游弋
[01:50.367]But still that whale did go
[01:53.230]Wellerman很快就要来了
[01:53.231]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:55.480]给我们带来糖 茶和朗姆酒
[01:55.487]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:58.170]等到一切结束的那一天
[01:58.175]One day when the tonguin' is done
[02:00.340]我们就能离开了
[02:00.349]We'll take our leave and go
[02:02.970]据我所知 这场博弈还在进行着
[02:02.973]As far as I've heard the fight's still on
[02:05.550]钓索没有断 鲸鱼也没逃脱
[02:05.552]The line's not cut and the whale's not gone
[02:08.040]Wellerman就像往常那样
[02:08.048]The Wellerman makes his regular call
[02:10.440]鼓舞船长和船员他们
[02:10.448]To encourage the captain crew and all
